# === Anti-harvest: block public access to internal markdown / docs folders. ===
# Canonical public URLs: redirect file-extension variants to the clean URLs
# already used by navigation, canonical tags and JSON-LD.
/investering.html    /investering    301!
/franchise.html      /franchise      301!

# Trigger: 2026-04-28 audit found peakrenewal.dk/CLAUDE.md publicly serving
# plaintext info@ via Netlify (any .md tracked in repo root is served by
# default). See .claude/rules/global-rules.md - "Contact Info Exposure Rule
# (CRITICAL - HARD STOP, anti-harvest)". Force 404 on any of:
# Explicit filenames first. `/*.md / 404!` does NOT match /CLAUDE.md on Netlify
# (splat vs extension) and rewriting to `/` still served the markdown as 200.
/CLAUDE.md           /404.html       404!
/README.md           /404.html       404!
/*.md                /404.html       404!
/*/*.md              /404.html       404!
/*/*/*.md            /404.html       404!
/docs/*              /404.html       404!
/.claude/*           /404.html       404!
# === end anti-harvest ===
